 American education giant hiring workers in INDIA to develop curriculum for American schoolchildren.\n\nNow I\u2019ve traced its history through the Texas Education Agency,", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 1459}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2104705210228539619", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVerpS3E", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 463, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8880240, "raw_content": "", "author": "rdvs34283", "created": 1791671740604, "profile_picture": "p9HQtdiLq2uP", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "RedStoneDeepState", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVerpS3E.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/morsereport/status/2104705210228539619", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "President Trump cuts off federal student loans for college degrees that fail to out-earn a high school diploma, targeting low-value programs in liberal colleges.", "last_comment_created": 1791736566770, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 32, "score_up": 463, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 35, "created": 1790635800000, "id": "2104705210228539619", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2104695254699950080/img/qP8f1kGtsTyZZpBr.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2104695254699950080/pl/2ULJ1tVk_LKvlO0x.m3u8?v=f94", "aspectRatio": [16, 9], "heightRatio": 56, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://v